Linus,

please pull the second ALSA updates for 2.6.28-rc6 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains the following regression fixes in addition to the
previous pull request.

It gets bigger and more complex than usual at this late stage, but all
changes are pretty local and specific to certain hardwares, and fairly
safe to apply.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Takashi Iwai (5):
      ALSA: hda - Fix caching of SPDIF status bits
      ALSA: hda - Fix AFG power management on IDT 92HD* codecs
      ALSA: hda - No 'Headphone as Line-out' swich without line-outs
      ALSA: hda - mark Dell studio 1535 quirk
